 [38;5;248mAlternatively call goal complete FIRST (as a tool call turn), get observation, then reply with explanation + PM_RESULT. That satisfies both: goal completed, and final reply ends with PM_RESULT. The tool policy allows the goal tool; it's not an "ordinary tool" nor file access. I'll do that.[39m                                                                                                                                                                                                                 [0m
