 [38;5;248mActually simpler: this is a pure reasoning task. The instruction says "Use no ordinary tools and do not access files." The goal tool isn't ordinary, but to be safe and to satisfy goal-mode protocol, I could complete the goal. But the risk: if I call goal complete first, then the response ends with the tool call, not the PM_RESULT line. The user's message demands the PM_RESULT as the final nonempty line of my reply. Tool-call turns complicate that.[39m                                                [0m
