[0m[K [38;5;248mGiven constraints explicitly forbid ordinary tools and file access, and the deliverable is self-evident, I'll just answer directly with the explanation and the PM_RESULT line. I will also call goal complete? The goal_context says before goal complete, verify deliverables against current state — here the deliverable is the emitted JSON, fully determined by admitted receipts. No external state to verify since we're forbidden from accessing anything. So completing is justified.[39m                    [0m
